    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but even \"doing nothing\" feels like too much work. like i have to keep up appearances, keep pretending im okay, keep managing everything... it's just constant. like i'm staring at a mountain i have to climb every single day and i just dont have the strength to even look at it anymore. it feels like there's no actual \"rest\" that works.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
